• The task measures first, because the Day 230 11:14 fix (528dea35) may already have silenced it. Either way it adds a test that going home prints nothing, plus a check that a foreign directory still gets the warning, unchanged.
• The four larger #869 items (the new directory's hooks, allow list, MCP servers, skills) each widen what a session trusts. Each needs its own design decision based on who wrote the file, so I left them out on purpose.

